WEBVTT

00:00:52.080 --> 00:00:54.840
DAS DAKAN DE MERTRAN CHAAT

00:00:54.840 --> 00:01:00.000
SA, MI PROTOCADRAS PREGIRT MI DEBRAN DAKAN DE CAN CHAAT

00:01:00.800 --> 00:01:30.000
My grand zukara. Eskes lo mertran chat de dance lascas. Tarl. Nilke de brandakan menatekarte. Elkel zangir test. De gadras ternest zentra. Nena eskes. De gadras ternesta. Mite.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:33.460
The brand come, yet, the Arkes.

00:05:00.510 --> 00:05:15.650
It's already been five months since the first time I played with all of you, and now that we're all out of the game.

00:05:15.650 --> 00:05:22.120
I think there's a lot of people out there who've had a hard time because of all the things we've been through.

00:06:35.080 --> 00:06:38.070
Our ship is to make a transformation in 3 minutes.

00:06:38.070 --> 00:06:41.830
Go to the nearest shelter as soon as possible.

00:06:41.830 --> 00:06:44.610
Attention!

00:06:44.610 --> 00:06:46.590
We get out! We get out!

00:06:47.590 --> 00:06:56.130
Go to the nearest shelter.

00:06:56.130 --> 00:06:59.920
Force修正 COA+A15.

00:07:10.560 --> 00:07:13.090
- -

00:10:01.180 --> 00:10:04.420
I'm not joking. I saved you, but that's not how you say it, right?

00:10:04.420 --> 00:10:08.850
There's an enemy in front of me.

00:10:08.850 --> 00:10:11.650
The enemy is invading! Shut up, Haruka!

00:10:11.650 --> 00:10:15.300
Leave it to the Second Defense Force. This is an order.

00:10:15.300 --> 00:10:16.950
I won't take your order.

00:10:16.950 --> 00:10:18.770
Enter the gunner and eliminate the enemy.

00:10:18.770 --> 00:10:19.950
Over.

00:10:19.950 --> 00:10:22.150
Ah, wait a minute!

00:10:22.150 --> 00:10:26.560
Which one is more important, a man or a woman?

00:10:37.420 --> 00:10:40.020
I wonder if she's okay.

00:10:40.020 --> 00:10:43.670
It's more intense than usual.

00:11:00.640 --> 00:11:01.380
BILDA!

00:11:01.380 --> 00:11:04.980
YAD!

00:11:04.980 --> 00:11:06.770
ZENTRON TO MELTRON!

00:11:06.770 --> 00:11:08.350
ZENTRON TO MELTRON?

00:11:08.350 --> 00:11:09.770
ZENTRON TO MELTRON!

00:11:09.770 --> 00:11:10.770
TALKIN.COM!

00:11:12.910 --> 00:11:14.310
YAAAK!

00:11:14.310 --> 00:11:17.060
YAK TE KALCHA!

00:12:00.030 --> 00:12:01.960
The subsystem is inoperable!

00:13:00.120 --> 00:13:02.120
Confirmed. Automatic tracking device active.

00:13:02.120 --> 00:13:03.500
Energy level rising.

00:13:03.500 --> 00:13:06.050
Attack standby.

00:14:06.430 --> 00:14:26.410
- No way! - What about me?

00:14:26.510 --> 00:14:27.400
Oh, yes!

00:14:32.300 --> 00:14:33.800
You saved me.

00:14:33.800 --> 00:14:37.960
I... I'm from the Earth Fusion Army, Valkyrie Skull Squadron.

00:14:37.960 --> 00:14:40.550
I'm Sh... Shoei Ichiohikaru.

00:14:40.550 --> 00:14:42.450
Thank you, Mr. Shoei.

00:14:42.450 --> 00:14:45.100
You're welcome. I'm a big fan.

00:14:45.100 --> 00:14:48.400
I'm happy. Are you listening to my song?

00:14:48.400 --> 00:14:51.390
Yes, I'm always listening.

00:14:51.390 --> 00:14:56.740
I'm sure everyone's worried.

00:14:56.740 --> 00:14:59.730
Hey, Mr. Shoei, where are we?

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:00.840
Would you like to join us?

00:15:00.840 --> 00:15:02.250
What?

00:15:02.250 --> 00:15:06.820
Here you go.

00:15:06.820 --> 00:15:07.940
Oh, thank you!

00:15:07.940 --> 00:15:12.290
I fell in love with the engine block.

00:15:12.290 --> 00:15:13.830
Is there an exit somewhere?

00:15:13.830 --> 00:15:15.290
I'll take a look.

00:15:18.360 --> 00:15:23.080
I don't think so.

00:15:23.080 --> 00:15:25.060
Can't you break it?

00:15:25.060 --> 00:15:25.990
I can't.

00:15:25.990 --> 00:15:27.580
It's made of hypercarbon.

00:15:27.580 --> 00:15:29.760
Just a moment, please.

00:15:31.440 --> 00:15:32.980
There's a lot of noise, so I can't use it.

00:15:32.980 --> 00:15:35.360
Can't you use an airplane's radio?

00:15:35.360 --> 00:15:38.000
That's no good. It's broken.

00:15:38.000 --> 00:15:43.750
I see.

00:15:43.750 --> 00:15:55.320
That's just right.

00:15:55.320 --> 00:15:59.700
There's already a lot of paper schedules.

00:16:02.040 --> 00:16:03.900
Now you can take a deep breath.

00:16:07.000 --> 00:16:10.760
What's wrong, Mr. Shoei?

00:16:10.760 --> 00:16:13.800
Macross has sent a message from Titan!

00:16:13.800 --> 00:16:15.060
What?

00:16:15.060 --> 00:16:20.170
It's true!

00:16:20.170 --> 00:16:28.060
We can't control the power!

00:16:28.060 --> 00:16:29.000
What?

00:16:31.080 --> 00:16:32.390
If you cling on to me like that...

00:16:36.740 --> 00:16:37.650
It's an accident!

00:16:37.650 --> 00:16:39.030
It's a mistake!

00:16:39.030 --> 00:16:41.140
Oh, but do something about it!

00:16:41.140 --> 00:16:42.770
Ah, ah...

00:16:42.770 --> 00:16:46.420
Shake your legs in front of you, and slowly stop it.

00:16:46.420 --> 00:16:53.140
That's how you do it.

00:16:53.140 --> 00:16:55.480
This is fun!

00:16:55.480 --> 00:16:59.700
Ah, Minmei-san!

00:17:00.220 --> 00:17:09.870
Wait! Hey, Mimei-san! Ouch!

00:17:09.870 --> 00:17:11.940
I broke the light.

00:17:36.680 --> 00:17:38.680
There's a mountain of tits swimming around!

00:17:38.680 --> 00:17:44.080
They're all running away!

00:19:02.940 --> 00:19:07.400
My, Debra Dacan, Kerkast, Kerkadens. Erkes, Descartes.

00:19:08.170 --> 00:19:11.670
O danz, my, Debra Dacan, Maiklan, Erkes, Tarn.

00:19:11.850 --> 00:19:12.990
Odem, tesugor.

00:19:16.050 --> 00:19:18.650
Ja, zentran, temmertran, Maiklan.

00:19:19.210 --> 00:19:23.070
Sa, det teres, Tarn, zentran, temmertran, okest.

00:19:23.390 --> 00:19:25.150
Mena, Martes, eskest.

00:19:25.760 --> 00:19:27.240
Jak, det danz.

00:19:28.060 --> 00:19:29.540
Mena, Descartes.

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:58.450
*Muchas*

00:20:10.560 --> 00:20:18.850
*Mario's voice*

00:20:52.840 --> 00:20:56.660
Anyway, it's not decided that he's still dead.

00:20:56.660 --> 00:20:58.100
Yes.

00:20:58.100 --> 00:21:00.000
Today, we will thoroughly investigate the west side block.

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:01.870
I'll look for him.

00:21:01.870 --> 00:21:03.620
I'm counting on you.

00:21:03.620 --> 00:21:04.480
Excuse me.

00:21:04.480 --> 00:21:08.770
You haven't found that boy, have you?

00:21:08.770 --> 00:21:10.930
It's been three days since then.

00:21:10.930 --> 00:21:12.750
I saw him in the army,

00:21:12.750 --> 00:21:14.570
but I think he got scared and ran away.

00:21:14.570 --> 00:21:15.480
No way.

00:21:15.480 --> 00:21:17.590
I don't think he's going to join the army.

00:21:17.590 --> 00:21:20.710
It's a blessing for a man to apologize for his work.

00:21:20.710 --> 00:21:25.290
I just thought it would be better to change my job for him.

00:21:25.290 --> 00:21:28.260
You're as strict as ever.

00:21:28.260 --> 00:21:29.270
If that's the case...

00:21:29.270 --> 00:21:30.000
How long will it take?

00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:32.000
But I don't have any money for my bride.

00:21:33.250 --> 00:21:34.300
It's okay.

00:21:34.300 --> 00:21:36.820
I don't want to be a girl anymore.

00:21:36.820 --> 00:21:38.380
I've been a girl for a long time.

00:21:38.380 --> 00:21:40.800
You're talking like an old woman again.

00:21:40.800 --> 00:21:42.140
But it's okay.

00:21:42.140 --> 00:21:43.280
I'll take care of it.

00:22:09.790 --> 00:22:12.710
And so, both my father and mother said this.

00:22:12.710 --> 00:22:16.570
"Do you know how much my brother has suffered?"

00:22:16.570 --> 00:22:19.570
"If you don't listen to me, I'll cut off your parents' marriage."

00:22:19.570 --> 00:22:22.450
That's why I said this.

00:22:22.450 --> 00:22:26.060
"Thank you for taking care of me for a long time."

00:22:26.060 --> 00:22:29.330
"I will definitely become a singer."

00:22:29.330 --> 00:22:30.000
And then?

00:22:35.310 --> 00:22:37.550
I just jumped out of the house.

00:22:37.550 --> 00:22:39.460
That's amazing.

00:22:39.460 --> 00:22:47.210
But I think I said too much.

00:22:47.210 --> 00:22:52.840
I hope my mom and dad are safe.

00:22:52.840 --> 00:22:57.110
Aren't you on the Macross?

00:22:57.110 --> 00:22:59.090
It's the Earth.

00:23:01.470 --> 00:23:04.880
The Earth?

00:23:04.880 --> 00:23:13.430
Don't you know what happened to the Earth?

00:23:13.430 --> 00:23:18.580
The announcement said that the radiation was too strong to be contacted, but...

00:23:18.580 --> 00:23:20.680
That's not it, it's the truth.

00:23:20.680 --> 00:23:26.240
We've been hit hard, so I don't think we should just let it go.

00:23:30.000 --> 00:23:32.880
Oh, I don't have to worry about it that much.

00:23:32.880 --> 00:23:40.590
Anyway, after a month, I can go back to Earth.

00:23:40.590 --> 00:23:43.790
Hey, can I ask you something?

00:23:43.790 --> 00:23:46.980
About the TV show the other day.

00:23:46.980 --> 00:23:50.480
On the night I want to cry, I had a conversation with the person who played that person.

00:23:50.480 --> 00:23:53.090
Oh, are you serious about it too?

00:23:53.090 --> 00:23:55.570
It's your magazine's story!

00:23:55.570 --> 00:24:00.000
But, you know, I really don't know about that love scene.

00:24:00.090 --> 00:24:10.420
I was really close to it.

00:24:10.420 --> 00:24:12.420
You can do it. It's business.

00:24:12.420 --> 00:24:13.790
No way.

00:24:13.790 --> 00:24:15.790
Let's give it a try.

00:24:15.790 --> 00:24:16.870
Give it a try?

00:24:16.870 --> 00:24:17.920
Yes.

00:24:30.540 --> 00:24:33.680
Actually, I've always loved you.

00:24:33.680 --> 00:24:42.640
You don't love me, do you?

00:24:42.640 --> 00:24:44.690
No, I love you!

00:24:44.690 --> 00:24:47.280
Really?

00:24:47.280 --> 00:24:50.440
Y-Yes, I love you!

00:24:50.440 --> 00:24:51.410
I'm so happy.

00:25:30.670 --> 00:25:35.390
This time, Minmei-san was saved, so we were told to forgive her.

00:25:35.830 --> 00:25:39.240
However, if you break the order, it will not be for free.

00:25:39.650 --> 00:25:41.800
We will punish you severely.

00:25:44.720 --> 00:25:45.780
Do you want to say something?

00:25:46.260 --> 00:25:46.760
No.

00:25:47.970 --> 00:25:49.860
Please be careful from now on, okay?

00:25:51.610 --> 00:25:52.370
Okay?

00:25:52.690 --> 00:25:53.190
Yes!

00:26:04.540 --> 00:26:06.440
Hey, is that a girl?

00:26:06.440 --> 00:26:17.630
Hey, Hikaru!

00:26:17.630 --> 00:26:21.490
Hey, Mr. Color Man!

00:26:21.490 --> 00:26:24.020
You did a good job!

00:26:24.020 --> 00:26:24.820
No...

00:26:24.820 --> 00:26:25.700
How was it?

00:26:25.700 --> 00:26:27.800
How does our idol, Minmei-chan, taste?

00:26:27.800 --> 00:26:28.610
Huh?

00:26:28.610 --> 00:26:30.000
Is Shijou-senpai that kind of person?

00:26:30.000 --> 00:26:31.140
I'm sorry.

00:26:31.140 --> 00:26:32.990
Tell me the details!

00:26:32.990 --> 00:26:34.990
I didn't do anything.

00:26:34.990 --> 00:26:36.030
You liar!

00:26:36.030 --> 00:26:37.910
I'm really, really stupid.

00:26:37.910 --> 00:26:39.860
You should take responsibility.

00:26:39.860 --> 00:26:42.040
I really didn't do anything.

00:26:42.040 --> 00:26:46.620
So, you didn't do anything with just the two of you for three days?

00:26:46.620 --> 00:26:47.620
No, I didn't.

00:26:47.620 --> 00:26:50.440
What? Are you a man or something?

00:26:50.440 --> 00:26:51.770
You idiot.

00:26:51.770 --> 00:26:52.720
What?

00:26:52.720 --> 00:27:00.000
I'm the pilot of the Spookily Unit, Shouji Ichijou.

00:27:00.320 --> 00:27:01.240
What?

00:27:01.240 --> 00:27:03.540
The other party is a military man.

00:27:03.540 --> 00:27:04.540
They say it's an indecent relationship.

00:27:04.540 --> 00:27:05.540
See?

00:27:05.540 --> 00:27:07.540
It's exactly what I said, isn't it?

00:27:07.540 --> 00:27:08.780
You're right.

00:27:08.780 --> 00:27:11.780
There's no way there are any young people these days.

00:27:11.780 --> 00:27:14.470
Of course, the entertainment industry is disturbed.

00:27:14.470 --> 00:27:17.470
What's the next man?

00:27:17.470 --> 00:27:22.100
I don't want to switch lovers like that.

00:27:22.100 --> 00:27:23.100
What are you talking about?

00:27:23.100 --> 00:27:25.100
You're really envious.

00:27:25.100 --> 00:27:25.920
Yup.

00:27:25.920 --> 00:27:26.970
I don't want to.

00:27:26.970 --> 00:27:27.490
I don't want to.

00:27:30.350 --> 00:27:31.350
I don't know anything.

00:27:31.350 --> 00:27:32.820
Yeah, yeah.

00:28:16.350 --> 00:28:19.330
Major, I brought you the patrol report for tomorrow.

00:28:19.330 --> 00:28:23.040
Well, thank you for your hard work. Drink as much as you want.

00:28:23.040 --> 00:28:24.530
No, thank you.

00:28:24.530 --> 00:28:25.920
Just sit down.

00:28:25.920 --> 00:28:28.270
But...

00:28:28.270 --> 00:28:29.860
I'm going home.

00:28:30.800 --> 00:28:32.530
I wonder if it's in the way.

00:28:32.530 --> 00:28:33.650
Hey, Hikaru.

00:28:33.650 --> 00:28:35.220
The commander is worried about you.

00:28:35.220 --> 00:28:36.580
Sit down quickly.

00:28:36.580 --> 00:28:42.060
Yes.

00:28:42.060 --> 00:28:44.550
What's wrong with you, Hayase?

00:28:44.550 --> 00:28:46.040
Geez.

00:28:46.040 --> 00:28:48.820
If you leave me, you'll look a little like a woman.

00:28:48.820 --> 00:28:51.000
I can't fix my personality easily.

00:28:51.000 --> 00:28:52.960
Hahahaha.

00:28:52.960 --> 00:28:55.560
You're annoying.

00:28:55.560 --> 00:28:57.120
Listen, Hayase.

00:28:57.120 --> 00:29:00.000
No matter how much you say that you're the master of Shikan School, you're a woman.

00:29:00.000 --> 00:29:05.010
Sometimes it's important to admit that a man's words are wrong.

00:29:05.010 --> 00:29:08.420
- Hey, Hikaru. - Yes.

00:29:08.420 --> 00:29:12.480
A man needs to be hard-working sometimes.

00:29:12.480 --> 00:29:15.680
Don't think too much about women's feelings.

00:29:15.680 --> 00:29:16.800
If you really like her,

00:29:16.800 --> 00:29:20.430
it's important to be strong enough to make her yours.

00:29:20.430 --> 00:29:23.650
- I see. - Lawyer, you talk too much.

00:29:23.650 --> 00:29:27.570
Listen, I'm going to teach you the beauty of a man and a woman from now on.

00:29:27.570 --> 00:29:30.000
Look me in the eye.

00:29:31.370 --> 00:29:36.640
Roy? Isn't that you?

00:29:36.640 --> 00:29:38.050
I don't give a damn.

00:29:38.050 --> 00:29:39.480
Roy!

00:29:39.480 --> 00:29:41.630
What are you doing?

00:29:49.310 --> 00:29:50.730
Excuse me.

00:29:50.730 --> 00:29:53.740
Lord Ichijo has a call for you.

00:29:53.740 --> 00:29:54.720
For me?

00:29:54.720 --> 00:29:56.320
It's from one of your family members.

00:29:56.320 --> 00:29:57.360
Family?

00:30:01.630 --> 00:30:03.490
Um, it's just a matter of time, but...

00:30:03.490 --> 00:30:04.260
Eh?

00:30:04.260 --> 00:30:09.800
Then...

00:30:09.800 --> 00:30:11.910
What's wrong, Hikaru?

00:30:11.910 --> 00:30:15.910
I-I'm sorry, my family is in a bad state.

00:30:15.910 --> 00:30:21.700
Your family?

00:30:34.160 --> 00:30:35.340
I'm sorry to keep you waiting.

00:30:35.340 --> 00:30:36.560
No, I don't want to.

00:30:36.560 --> 00:30:38.080
Do you understand?

00:30:38.080 --> 00:30:39.160
Yes, I do.

00:30:39.160 --> 00:30:40.970
I have a lot of photos.

00:30:40.970 --> 00:30:44.370
I did my best to transform them.

00:30:44.370 --> 00:30:46.750
Are you sure you can do this?

00:30:46.750 --> 00:30:52.360
I don't want to do it with you.

00:30:52.360 --> 00:30:53.650
Alright.

00:30:53.650 --> 00:30:56.620
Then, let's have a good time tonight.

00:30:57.770 --> 00:30:58.610
Okay.

00:32:51.820 --> 00:32:58.580
I don't want to live like this anymore.

00:32:59.290 --> 00:33:00.000
You want to be a singer?

00:33:00.250 --> 00:33:02.060
It was a dream, wasn't it?

00:33:02.060 --> 00:33:23.610
I have to put up with it for a while.

00:33:23.610 --> 00:33:24.320
Where?

00:33:44.400 --> 00:33:45.040
I'll give it to you.

00:34:03.900 --> 00:34:18.530
I'm going to take you to the hospital.

00:34:32.620 --> 00:34:34.510
I don't want to do anything.

00:34:34.510 --> 00:34:35.590
That's right!

00:34:35.590 --> 00:34:36.680
Elkest!

00:34:36.680 --> 00:34:39.870
Delran Maltest!

00:34:39.870 --> 00:34:40.870
Yes, sir!

00:34:40.870 --> 00:34:45.000
I have the power of the Maltest!

00:34:45.000 --> 00:34:49.140
I have the power of the Maltest!

00:34:49.140 --> 00:34:51.430
Elkest!

00:34:51.430 --> 00:34:52.570
I have the power of the Maltest!

00:34:52.570 --> 00:34:53.550
I have the power of the Maltest!

00:34:53.550 --> 00:34:54.550
I have the power of the Maltest!

00:34:54.550 --> 00:34:55.550
I have the power of the Maltest!

00:34:55.550 --> 00:34:56.550
I have the power of the Maltest!

00:34:56.550 --> 00:34:57.550
I have the power of the Maltest!

00:34:57.550 --> 00:34:58.950
I have the power of the Maltest!

00:34:58.950 --> 00:35:00.000
I have the power of the Maltest!

00:35:00.000 --> 00:35:17.890
*multiple*

00:36:31.340 --> 00:36:32.020
Yes.

00:36:32.020 --> 00:36:34.040
I'm shocked.

00:36:34.040 --> 00:36:36.080
He used Valkyrie for Yoshio.

00:36:36.080 --> 00:36:38.530
It's not Hikaru's fault.

00:36:38.530 --> 00:36:41.080
I forced him to do it.

00:36:41.080 --> 00:36:43.060
Minmei, go back quickly.

00:36:43.060 --> 00:36:43.950
Brother!

00:36:43.950 --> 00:36:44.850
Ichijou.

00:36:44.850 --> 00:36:47.600
If the mass media finds out about this,

00:36:47.600 --> 00:36:49.460
Minmei's life as a servant is over.

00:36:49.460 --> 00:36:51.890
I tried my luck,

00:36:51.890 --> 00:36:53.910
but I don't have mercy on you.

00:36:53.910 --> 00:36:55.400
I know.

00:36:55.400 --> 00:36:56.920
I'm prepared for the punishment.

00:36:56.920 --> 00:36:58.840
What a soldier!

00:36:58.840 --> 00:37:00.000
Go back quickly!

00:37:00.440 --> 00:37:02.020
Got it.

00:37:02.020 --> 00:37:03.140
Let's go home.

00:37:06.020 --> 00:37:07.650
Oh no!

00:37:07.650 --> 00:37:17.410
Do something!

00:37:17.410 --> 00:37:20.800
