00:41:37.330 --> 00:41:49.140
I'm going to kill you!

00:41:49.140 --> 00:41:50.140
I'm going to kill you!

00:41:50.140 --> 00:41:54.620
I'm going to kill you!

00:41:54.620 --> 00:41:56.060
I'm going to kill you!

