What?

00:42:00.640 --> 00:42:02.420
Oh, oh, oh, oh, oh.

00:42:04.250 --> 00:42:05.330
Jesus.

00:42:06.800 --> 00:42:07.840
Oh, oh, oh, oh, oh.

00:42:34.700 --> 00:42:38.640
