00:43:01.050 --> 00:43:11.510
Armadagan Togadora, Meltran Udezantzalni Maikran Holdo Giltsu, Meltran Gadrakilkas Bekkarcha.

00:43:11.510 --> 00:43:19.770
Palmi Brita, Armadan Giltesu, Maikran Elkestu Kei, Togal Odorzu.

00:43:19.770 --> 00:43:25.210
