00:45:14.490 --> 00:45:16.750
Ma Chameleon Tereruke Madras de Arkes.

00:45:21.710 --> 00:45:24.320
Wow!

00:45:43.280 --> 00:45:45.030
A woman is fighting!

00:45:45.030 --> 00:45:46.420
