00:49:13.000 --> 00:49:15.120
You don't know, do you?

00:49:15.120 --> 00:49:18.750
- What about the enemy ship? - There's no signal from anywhere.

00:49:18.750 --> 00:49:27.240
Right. Even so, it's a bad omen.

00:49:27.240 --> 00:49:30.000
I can see the sea over there. Let's head over there.

00:49:32.140 --> 00:49:33.240
What's going to happen?

00:49:34.220 --> 00:49:36.970
We won't be able to see Minmei.

00:49:37.180 --> 00:49:38.300
What are you talking about?

00:49:40.170 --> 00:49:43.940
Minmei will be killed too, just like Senpai.

00:49:46.180 --> 00:49:49.140
I have to take her with me.

00:49:49.330 --> 00:49:52.570
But our mission is to find out where this place is.

00:49:53.800 --> 00:49:56.640
Mission, mission! Is that all you've got?

00:49:57.430 --> 00:50:00.000
I understand. I'm counting on you.

00:50:02.430 --> 00:50:03.970
- Hey!

00:50:30.000 --> 00:50:47.570
I belong to the Pacific fleet.

00:50:47.570 --> 00:50:51.600
