00:50:51.600 --> 00:50:53.390
Sakao!

00:50:53.390 --> 00:50:58.480
I can't believe it's my Earth!

00:53:16.920 --> 00:53:19.390
Proto-culture!

00:53:19.390 --> 00:53:22.360
This is Karchun Maikuran.

00:53:22.360 --> 00:53:24.270
Dance Proto-culture.

00:53:24.270 --> 00:53:25.190
Karchun.

00:53:25.190 --> 00:53:27.440
Karchun is the name of a girl.

00:53:27.440 --> 00:53:29.360
Her name is Zanchuke.

00:53:30.220 --> 00:53:32.610
I want to tell you something.

00:53:32.610 --> 00:53:34.490
What?

00:53:34.490 --> 00:53:38.160
I want to talk to you about something.

00:53:38.160 --> 00:53:41.380
I want to tell you something.

00:53:41.380 --> 00:53:46.200
I want to tell you something.

00:53:46.200 --> 00:53:47.060
What is it?

00:53:47.060 --> 00:53:49.750
I want to tell you something.

00:53:49.750 --> 00:53:52.200
I want to tell you something.

00:53:52.200 --> 00:53:53.850
What is it?

00:53:53.850 --> 00:53:56.960
I want to tell you something.

00:53:56.960 --> 00:53:59.380
I want to tell you something.

00:54:00.000 --> 00:54:03.700
I am the leader of the Karchun Napolod Culture.

00:54:03.700 --> 00:54:06.790
I am the leader of the Eskeskama Guild.

00:54:06.790 --> 00:54:08.780
Oh!

00:54:08.780 --> 00:54:13.410
My name is Zentrante Meltran, and I am the leader of the Karchakama Maga.

00:54:13.410 --> 00:54:17.990
You are the leader of the Karchakama Maga?

00:54:17.990 --> 00:54:19.330
That's right.

00:54:39.120 --> 00:54:42.710
I'm Kengiru, and I'm here to teach you how to do it.

00:54:42.710 --> 00:54:45.100
Teach you how to do it?

00:54:45.100 --> 00:54:50.100
I'm not going to teach you how to do it, but I'm going to teach you how to do it.

00:55:24.700 --> 00:55:30.000
So in the end, Tokyo was destroyed, and Alaska was unified.

00:55:30.000 --> 00:55:32.430
The Imperial Army Headquarters is also in the lava.

00:55:32.430 --> 00:55:39.360
I can't find anyone anywhere for the next week.

00:55:39.360 --> 00:55:42.360
Now, Captain Hayase, where do you want to go next?

00:55:42.360 --> 00:55:45.620
London? Or Paris?

00:55:45.620 --> 00:55:47.200
New York?

00:55:47.200 --> 00:55:48.520
Hurry up and give me an order.

00:55:48.520 --> 00:55:51.130
Stop it.

00:55:51.130 --> 00:55:52.240
Please stop it.

00:56:22.360 --> 00:56:30.000
You haven't eaten, have you?

00:56:30.830 --> 00:56:32.240
I have to eat a little.

00:56:32.240 --> 00:56:37.200
If you're going to eat something like that, you'd better die.

00:56:37.200 --> 00:56:44.360
The radioactive detergent works, so it's not a big deal.

00:56:44.360 --> 00:56:47.860
Surviving is a soldier's mission, right?

00:56:47.860 --> 00:56:52.270
It's over.

00:56:52.270 --> 00:56:55.930
But we got off to Earth.

00:56:55.930 --> 00:56:59.090
If Macross is safe, he'll be back soon.

00:57:02.910 --> 00:57:05.960
You don't understand anything, do you?

00:57:05.960 --> 00:57:08.920
Even if Macross comes, nothing will change.

00:57:08.920 --> 00:57:10.810
Why?

00:57:10.810 --> 00:57:13.850
No one on Earth is left.

00:57:13.850 --> 00:57:16.200
But if Macross' people are here...

00:57:16.200 --> 00:57:18.300
The Earth will be destroyed.

00:57:18.300 --> 00:57:22.630
The enemy is an enemy who can destroy millions of people in a blink of an eye.

00:57:39.340 --> 00:57:41.330
The commander of the army who knew he was going to lose...

00:57:41.330 --> 00:57:48.210
"You're tough, aren't you?"

00:57:48.210 --> 00:57:52.210
I heard it from Major Fokker.

00:57:52.210 --> 00:57:54.520
From Senpai?

00:57:54.520 --> 00:57:58.990
That you don't have a family.

00:57:58.990 --> 00:58:00.000
Your mother...

00:58:00.000 --> 00:58:03.240
