00:58:04.600 --> 00:58:09.470
Yeah, he was an acrobat and he said, "Hyoom! Don!"

00:58:09.920 --> 00:58:15.970
He must have lived alone all his life.

00:58:16.590 --> 00:58:18.370
He was just making money.

00:58:19.080 --> 00:58:21.990
He used to fly planes since he was a kid.

00:58:22.790 --> 00:58:27.810
But that's why he's fine now.

00:58:30.060 --> 00:58:31.060
I can't do this.

00:58:31.060 --> 00:58:34.100
I'm a soldier too.

00:58:34.100 --> 00:58:37.310
I thought I could survive even if I became the last soldier.

00:58:37.310 --> 00:58:39.670
But I can't do this.

00:58:46.290 --> 00:58:52.460
I'm sorry.

00:58:52.460 --> 00:58:53.140
I...

00:59:26.750 --> 00:59:28.640
What is that pillar?

00:59:30.000 --> 00:59:51.700
Looks like it's been sinking for a long time.

00:59:51.700 --> 00:59:56.850
It doesn't look like there are people.

00:59:56.850 --> 01:00:00.000
But some of the functions are still alive.

01:00:07.550 --> 01:00:09.630
They're the same size as us.

01:00:09.630 --> 01:00:16.640
If it's not the Titans, then it's a fold communication system.

01:00:16.640 --> 01:00:17.860
Fold communication?

01:00:17.860 --> 01:00:20.390
It's moving!

01:00:20.390 --> 01:00:21.060
Huh?

01:00:21.060 --> 01:00:23.340
We might be able to contact Bacross.

01:00:23.340 --> 01:00:27.430
But if the others see us, it'll be Zinja.

01:00:27.430 --> 01:00:30.000
I know. But we have to try it now.

01:00:31.850 --> 01:00:40.060
If Macross is safe, I'm sure he'll respond.

01:00:40.060 --> 01:00:42.030
No response.

01:00:42.030 --> 01:00:46.210
The machine must be broken.

01:00:46.210 --> 01:00:51.890
Maybe the operation method is wrong.

01:00:51.890 --> 01:00:54.160
Let's try something else.

01:01:14.400 --> 01:01:15.360
I'm going to take you home.

01:01:15.360 --> 01:01:17.170
You know?

01:01:17.170 --> 01:01:19.240
Just a little.

01:01:19.240 --> 01:01:20.160
What are you?

01:01:20.160 --> 01:01:21.130
I'm a pilot.

01:01:21.130 --> 01:01:26.220
A computer for space travel?

01:01:26.220 --> 01:01:28.580
Better than better than zero.

01:01:28.580 --> 01:01:30.000
No.

01:01:30.800 --> 01:01:32.640
We are the humans of this planet!

01:01:36.990 --> 01:01:38.130
The genealogy...

01:01:56.680 --> 01:01:59.310
It's gone...

01:02:06.810 --> 01:02:09.050
He switched the energy.

01:02:09.050 --> 01:02:10.810
What did he say?

01:02:10.810 --> 01:02:14.960
He said he'd use the remaining energy to destroy the city.

01:02:14.960 --> 01:02:16.930
Destroy the city?

01:02:16.930 --> 01:02:18.400
Yes.

01:02:18.400 --> 01:02:21.350
It moved!

01:02:30.600 --> 01:02:36.310
A long time ago, there was a space civilization called Protoculture.

01:02:36.310 --> 01:02:40.610
There, genetic engineering was developing.

01:02:40.610 --> 01:02:44.740
A man became a man, and a woman became a woman,

01:02:44.740 --> 01:02:47.190
and they were able to have more descendants.

01:02:47.190 --> 01:02:55.020
They divided into a man-only Zentradi and a woman-only Meltrandi,

01:02:55.020 --> 01:02:57.340
and started a war.

01:02:57.340 --> 01:02:59.540
What they created at that time was...

01:03:00.120 --> 01:03:06.340
Titans who only know how to fight.

01:03:06.340 --> 01:03:10.860
But the war between the titans has become too intense,

01:03:10.860 --> 01:03:16.060
and the people who finally realized their mistake

01:03:16.060 --> 01:03:20.280
are looking for a place where a man and a woman can live together.

01:03:20.280 --> 01:03:23.170
That's why they escaped to this earth.

01:03:30.380 --> 01:03:37.580
At that time, they used the genes of the living creatures on Earth to create our ancestors.

01:03:37.580 --> 01:03:42.640
Our ancestors?

01:03:42.640 --> 01:03:48.200
Then where did the people of this town go?

01:03:48.200 --> 01:03:53.730
20,000 years ago, when the titans' battle reached this solar system,

01:03:53.730 --> 01:03:59.320
they hid the town in the sea and temporarily separated from the Earth.

01:03:59.320 --> 01:03:59.960
But...

01:04:00.380 --> 01:04:03.360
I couldn't come back.

01:04:03.360 --> 01:04:08.480
So, half a year ago, when the Zentradi army appeared,

01:04:08.480 --> 01:04:12.770
the computer that sensed that the people of this city had returned

01:04:12.770 --> 01:04:16.380
ruined the city.

01:04:16.380 --> 01:04:21.900
So that we could live in this city?

01:04:21.900 --> 01:04:27.040
But we were the only ones who waited for 20,000 years.

01:04:30.160 --> 01:04:31.960
- That's right. - That's right.

01:04:33.850 --> 01:04:54.480
- It's quite damaged. - I don't know.

01:04:55.240 --> 01:04:58.420
- Did you find anything? - I think there's something written on it.

01:05:00.090 --> 01:05:03.630
"Remember"? "Remember"?

01:05:03.630 --> 01:05:06.390
Do you remember?

01:05:06.390 --> 01:05:08.390
It's much more complicated than the words of the titans.

01:05:08.390 --> 01:05:10.430
I don't understand.

01:05:10.430 --> 01:05:22.080
Yeah, it's just like a house.

01:05:22.080 --> 01:05:25.140
Let's go around the hill.

01:05:25.140 --> 01:05:26.990
Can I stay here a little longer?

01:05:26.990 --> 01:05:29.890
It's not a big deal, but...

01:05:31.240 --> 01:05:32.470
Something like that.

01:05:32.470 --> 01:05:34.800
I see.

01:05:34.800 --> 01:05:38.490
Then I'll go look for someone else.

01:05:38.490 --> 01:05:41.490
I'll be right back.

01:06:02.490 --> 01:06:03.680
It won't change, will it?

01:06:34.480 --> 01:06:36.850
It looks like there's no one here after all.

01:06:36.850 --> 01:06:42.330
Most of the machines are useless.

01:06:42.330 --> 01:06:49.050
Go home.

01:06:49.050 --> 01:06:51.390
I'm home.

01:06:51.390 --> 01:06:54.610
Let's have dinner.

01:07:15.360 --> 01:07:16.040
Liao Zhe.

01:07:58.510 --> 01:07:59.120
I want to go home.

01:08:02.140 --> 01:08:17.570
I'm sorry, Master.

01:09:01.720 --> 01:09:03.390
Is it starting to move again?

01:09:03.390 --> 01:09:05.800
No, this sound is coming from the sky.

01:09:05.800 --> 01:09:08.290
The sky?

01:09:30.380 --> 01:09:32.120
There was a phone call.

01:09:32.120 --> 01:09:32.820
Ah!

01:09:32.820 --> 01:09:46.110
One hour, Hikaru. Just now, I've arrived.

01:09:46.110 --> 01:09:59.700
Yeah. How's it?

01:10:02.460 --> 01:10:09.260
Over the past month, we've investigated 15,000 km of the Earth and the alien space ship.

01:10:09.260 --> 01:10:12.820
None of them survived.

01:10:12.820 --> 01:10:18.810
We'll receive the detailed report later.

01:10:18.810 --> 01:10:21.490
You should rest first.

01:10:21.490 --> 01:10:22.440
- Yes. - Yes.

01:10:44.270 --> 01:10:45.910
Roy was great.

01:10:45.910 --> 01:10:54.860
That's enough.

01:11:27.770 --> 01:11:29.670
*Song: I'm a little bit drunk*

01:11:32.650 --> 01:11:42.710
I'm lonely in the sea of the sea of the sea. If I step on it, my heart will be...

01:11:47.520 --> 01:11:55.280
How strange. Minmei-san has gone somewhere, but the song is still playing.

01:11:55.280 --> 01:11:57.420
Oh my.

01:12:02.040 --> 01:12:05.130
It's as if I'm alive.

01:12:05.130 --> 01:12:10.580
Yeah, it's kind of nostalgic.

01:12:10.580 --> 01:12:13.900
Nostalgic?

01:12:13.900 --> 01:12:18.930
It's only been a month since then,

01:12:18.930 --> 01:12:24.610
but I feel like it's been a long time since I left with Minmei.

01:12:32.880 --> 01:13:00.000
♪ ♪

01:13:02.080 --> 01:13:05.030
"Tou meltran rin-tsu ror-tsu de-an-re-kan."

01:13:05.030 --> 01:13:08.420
"Saa, rin-tsu meltran matras-kasu!"

01:13:08.420 --> 01:13:20.620
"Departure. We're approaching the coastline from Area 2-7."

01:13:20.620 --> 01:13:23.360
"It's predicted to be a female-only Meltrandi."

01:13:23.360 --> 01:13:24.990
"A female-only?"

01:13:24.990 --> 01:13:26.270
"I don't care!"

01:13:26.270 --> 01:13:28.650
"Don't underestimate a woman!"

01:13:28.650 --> 01:13:30.000
Those guys are...

01:13:30.640 --> 01:13:32.260
You're tougher than I thought!

01:13:32.260 --> 01:13:33.870
That's funny.

01:13:33.870 --> 01:13:35.460
Funny?

01:13:35.460 --> 01:13:37.330
What's wrong, Switch?

01:13:37.330 --> 01:13:39.320
You suddenly turned into a coward.

01:13:39.320 --> 01:13:40.580
What?

01:13:40.580 --> 01:13:42.680
Just like Captain Max said!

01:13:42.680 --> 01:13:45.280
Maybe it's because you're a woman!

01:13:45.280 --> 01:13:46.280
Hahahaha!

01:13:48.020 --> 01:13:52.680
Kaki-daki!

01:13:52.680 --> 01:13:54.710
It's a protoculture.

01:16:02.680 --> 01:16:04.230
Dammit, we can't let this go!

01:16:09.350 --> 01:16:11.400
Minmei?

01:16:11.400 --> 01:16:19.840
Why, Minmei?

01:16:53.550 --> 01:16:55.190
Meltran Matraskas is here.

01:16:55.190 --> 01:16:57.300
Everyone, hurry up!

01:16:57.300 --> 01:16:59.700
Parimalom is here.

01:17:19.230 --> 01:17:22.250
It's a success. Meltran has been removed.

01:17:22.250 --> 01:17:27.980
Kodansu, this Mii Zone will be the place where the people of the world went to.

01:17:27.980 --> 01:17:29.890
Meltran will be able to recover.

01:17:41.960 --> 01:17:45.330
Commander, the Zentradi army has signed a peace treaty.

01:17:45.330 --> 01:17:47.410
A peace treaty?

01:18:09.630 --> 01:18:23.910
From now on, the official announcement of the global ranking will be made.

01:18:34.060 --> 01:18:38.580
SDF-1 Macross of the Space Force...

01:18:38.580 --> 01:18:42.280
on the 11th of September, at 11:00 a.m.

01:18:42.280 --> 01:18:45.500
the 425th Zentradi Army...

01:18:45.500 --> 01:18:49.770
has formed a surprise fleet with Japanese troops.

01:18:59.000 --> 01:19:00.000
And now...

01:19:00.380 --> 01:19:05.350
This is the result of our investigation into the ruins of this space-time war.

01:19:05.350 --> 01:19:13.090
This was built on a planet 500,000 years ago by a holy man who wanted to build a planet.

01:19:13.090 --> 01:19:17.760
This is the origin of the Protoculture, an ancient civilization.

01:19:17.760 --> 01:19:25.890
We Earthlings, the Zentradi army, and the people of Meltrandi who are related to them...

01:19:25.890 --> 01:19:30.000
All of them are part of this Protoculture.

01:19:30.800 --> 01:19:34.850
It's been revealed that they have a gene structure.

01:19:34.850 --> 01:19:37.870
That's exactly what we were told!

01:19:37.870 --> 01:19:42.630
They were created by the amazing chemical power of their proto-culture

01:19:42.630 --> 01:19:47.900
by transforming human genes.

01:19:47.900 --> 01:19:52.770
Take a look.

01:19:52.770 --> 01:19:58.000
If you use their genetic engineering,

01:19:58.000 --> 01:20:00.000
you can turn giants into humans just like us.

01:20:00.000 --> 01:20:02.100
It is possible to return it to its original state.

01:20:02.100 --> 01:20:10.560
The three men who are seated here are the Zentradi people you just saw.

01:20:10.560 --> 01:20:26.040
They are combat people, divided into two forces called men and women, and have been fighting for 500,000 years.

01:20:26.040 --> 01:20:30.000
Protoculture's Erker self-declared to succeed in the operation.

01:20:30.000 --> 01:20:31.800
It's forbidden, isn't it?

01:20:31.800 --> 01:20:33.320
Yes.

01:20:33.320 --> 01:20:34.430
Makayak?

01:20:34.430 --> 01:20:37.920
Can you see those three?

01:20:37.920 --> 01:20:42.780
What did Micron send in to stop the Earthlings?

01:20:42.780 --> 01:20:49.410
I've never seen Zentran in such a cultured place.

01:20:55.240 --> 01:20:58.570
I want to be Micron too.

01:20:58.570 --> 01:21:00.000
Yat de culture!

01:21:01.150 --> 01:21:03.330
Hmph, you must be joking.

01:21:03.330 --> 01:21:04.260
Joking?

01:21:04.260 --> 01:21:05.310
You don't know?

01:21:05.310 --> 01:21:07.060
No.

01:21:07.060 --> 01:21:14.330
It seems that the proto-culture Minmei taught me is not true.

01:21:14.330 --> 01:21:15.740
Culture...

01:21:15.740 --> 01:21:24.390
Let me introduce you, the biggest super star in the galaxy, Lin Minmei!

01:21:38.540 --> 01:21:47.020
This melody that's playing now is a copy of a memory plate that's been passed down from time immemorial to the Zentradi army.

01:21:47.020 --> 01:21:54.170
But unfortunately, the lyrics of this song were not recorded on their memory plate.

01:21:54.170 --> 01:22:00.000
So now, the lyricists on the Macross are writing wonderful lyrics for this song.

01:22:02.330 --> 01:22:11.150
And we want to make a peaceful world with peace and harmony.

01:22:19.510 --> 01:22:23.110
If we can take the first step towards peace like this,

01:22:23.620 --> 01:22:26.930
it is because of the precious sacrifice of many people.

01:22:27.730 --> 01:22:30.000
If you think about it, it will be a painful and sad day.

01:22:30.000 --> 01:22:33.450
He was caught up in a war and turned into a prisoner.

01:22:33.450 --> 01:22:36.790
He was miraculously saved even though he had to part ways.

01:22:36.790 --> 01:22:40.110
The young men have endured the hardships.

01:22:40.110 --> 01:22:43.030
Now, tears are falling.

01:22:43.030 --> 01:22:46.700
The man Lin Minmei has been waiting for...

01:22:46.700 --> 01:22:51.880
is the chief operator of the Tōgō Army, Major Hayase.

01:22:51.880 --> 01:22:57.460
He is the captain of the Valkyrie Skull Squadron.

01:23:21.210 --> 01:23:26.920
- Minmei... - Hikaru! Hikaru!

01:23:31.600 --> 01:23:32.240
Hikaru!

01:24:10.010 --> 01:24:11.060
The season of dreams.

01:24:11.060 --> 01:24:22.380
I'm not so good at this.

01:24:22.380 --> 01:24:27.680
Do you remember, eyes and eyes?

01:25:27.710 --> 01:25:29.670
You're pretty busy right now, aren't you?

01:25:30.510 --> 01:25:34.200
Come to think of it, the singer of that song is...

01:25:34.200 --> 01:25:35.150
Minmei.

01:25:36.930 --> 01:25:40.650
I like you.

01:25:40.650 --> 01:25:47.630
I don't know what happened between us.

01:25:47.630 --> 01:25:53.040
But still, I like you.

01:26:11.840 --> 01:26:13.730
Minmei, I...

01:26:32.140 --> 01:26:33.040
Sousa...

01:26:38.430 --> 01:26:41.180
What?

01:26:41.180 --> 01:26:43.900
Do you remember what this is?

01:26:44.790 --> 01:26:50.390
It's a plate I found in the town of the ruins.

01:26:50.390 --> 01:26:55.290
When I was reading this, I knew it sounded like the lyrics to that song.

01:26:55.290 --> 01:26:57.750
That song?

01:27:00.120 --> 01:27:06.970
I wanted you to be the first one to know.

01:27:06.970 --> 01:27:10.620
Wait, that's not it!

01:27:10.620 --> 01:27:12.090
That's a misunderstanding!

01:27:12.090 --> 01:27:16.040
Misunderstanding?

01:27:16.040 --> 01:27:20.940
Misunderstanding?

01:27:20.940 --> 01:27:26.430
That's too much.

01:27:26.430 --> 01:27:28.200
Rinmei!

01:27:32.430 --> 01:27:33.770
We should hurry up and chase them.

01:27:33.770 --> 01:27:37.370
We've finally met again.

01:27:37.370 --> 01:27:39.320
There's no need to hold back.

01:27:39.320 --> 01:27:46.060
It's more miserable to be sympathized with them.

01:27:46.060 --> 01:27:46.700
That's not what I mean!

01:27:46.700 --> 01:27:49.680
That's not what I mean!

01:27:49.680 --> 01:27:58.160
We're going to wander the Earth where no one is.

01:28:00.830 --> 01:28:04.530
I'll be able to return to Macross safely.

01:28:04.530 --> 01:28:09.820
When I hear Minmei's song in the city,

01:28:09.820 --> 01:28:19.830
when I see her in the screen,

01:28:19.830 --> 01:28:25.600
I want you to be by my side forever.

01:28:30.000 --> 01:28:34.020
It's you.

01:28:34.020 --> 01:28:39.340
I'm still going to do that.

01:28:39.340 --> 01:28:43.500
Are you serious?

01:28:43.500 --> 01:28:50.550
I don't know when I'll die, but with a person like me...

01:29:42.190 --> 01:29:42.680
Oh!

01:30:02.300 --> 01:30:09.480
Maximum impact, that's real.

01:30:09.480 --> 01:30:19.140
This song is "Me Saagi".

01:30:36.330 --> 01:30:38.120
You haven't made a pair yet?

01:30:38.120 --> 01:30:39.710
Yes, Tarunin.

01:30:39.710 --> 01:30:42.590
The name of the people is Elkel, an unknown.

01:30:42.590 --> 01:30:45.700
Danz Dekarja.

01:30:45.700 --> 01:30:47.620
Horton Meltran Defold.

01:30:47.620 --> 01:30:48.470
Hm?

01:31:19.930 --> 01:31:23.910
Now you're the only one who can make Minmei sing a song!

01:31:23.910 --> 01:31:27.410
I promise, I'll make it happen!

01:31:27.410 --> 01:31:29.000
Defold!

01:31:29.000 --> 01:31:30.000
The song is incomplete.

01:31:30.000 --> 01:31:33.600
It's impossible to defeat Meltran in this state.

01:31:33.600 --> 01:31:36.270
If so, we will annihilate them all.

01:31:36.270 --> 01:31:40.340
The target is Laplavis Fleet, along with Macross.

01:31:40.340 --> 01:31:46.910
Arma Zeltran, Altgadron!

01:31:46.910 --> 01:31:52.290
It was all but a short peace.

01:31:52.290 --> 01:31:53.970
All ships, set off at once!

01:31:53.970 --> 01:31:57.970
To the Earth!

01:32:45.160 --> 01:32:45.880
Bodorusa

01:34:20.250 --> 01:34:20.840
Me mad.

01:34:30.960 --> 01:34:32.960
You came here for me, didn't you?

01:34:36.300 --> 01:34:39.270
I want you to sing this song for me.

01:34:40.470 --> 01:34:44.470
What's that? Why do I have to sing the song I found from that guy?

01:34:51.140 --> 01:34:53.140
Gans 4, this is the Garmaskara Inland Center.

01:34:53.750 --> 01:34:56.750
The circuit is damaged. The launch site is Gento.

01:34:57.330 --> 01:35:00.000
S-Cast, hold Gans right away.

01:35:01.240 --> 01:35:06.080
However, there are tens of thousands of soldiers in the shipyard with the Lapramids.

01:35:06.080 --> 01:35:13.220
I don't care. I'll guard them.

01:35:38.640 --> 01:35:42.040
You don't have any feelings for me, do you?

01:35:42.040 --> 01:35:50.930
Anyway, stay with me, Hikaru.

01:35:50.930 --> 01:35:54.830
If you're going to die anyway, I want to stay with you.

01:35:54.830 --> 01:35:58.720
It's not just our problem.

01:35:58.720 --> 01:36:00.000
I'm on the Macross.

01:36:00.000 --> 01:36:01.540
For everyone's sake!

01:36:01.540 --> 01:36:03.720
That has nothing to do with it!

01:36:03.720 --> 01:36:09.660
Why are we not the only ones in this world?

01:36:09.660 --> 01:36:12.560
Except for you and me...

01:36:12.560 --> 01:36:15.200
Everyone should just die!

01:36:35.050 --> 01:36:39.280
Senpai and Kakizaki have died.

01:36:39.280 --> 01:36:42.680
There are a lot of things I want to do.

01:37:00.060 --> 01:37:01.640
I'm still singing the song.

01:37:41.200 --> 01:37:46.130
I'm sorry, Hikaru.

01:37:46.130 --> 01:37:49.580
Something happened to me.

01:37:49.580 --> 01:37:55.970
I chose this path because I like it.

01:37:55.970 --> 01:37:57.800
If I don't sing here,

01:37:57.800 --> 01:38:00.000
the dead father and mother won't come to mind.

01:38:02.560 --> 01:38:07.610
- Minmei... - Yeah?

01:39:04.030 --> 01:39:06.600
This is the song of Mire.

01:39:06.600 --> 01:39:14.980
No way.

01:39:14.980 --> 01:39:18.980
I feel like I've heard this song a long time ago.

01:39:18.980 --> 01:39:20.870
Why?

01:39:36.300 --> 01:39:43.760
I understand. Our genetic provider, Carl June, is awake.

01:39:43.760 --> 01:39:44.760
What?

01:39:44.760 --> 01:39:48.440
We have exceeded the time of the 500,000 cycle.

01:39:48.440 --> 01:39:54.250
We must revive our culture.

01:40:30.760 --> 01:40:37.100
We will not lose the culture of the Proto Culture.

01:40:37.100 --> 01:40:43.520
I will tell everything to those who listen to my song.

01:40:43.520 --> 01:40:45.910
Our enemy is only one.

01:40:45.910 --> 01:40:52.980
Defeat Borug Odorza and regain the culture.

01:45:48.360 --> 01:45:50.670
Let's go to Delta-1 from Skull-1.

01:45:50.670 --> 01:45:54.080
Mission complete.

01:45:54.080 --> 01:45:55.700
We're going back now.

01:46:00.090 --> 01:46:01.990
This is Delta One, roger.

01:47:36.460 --> 01:47:39.810
It's going to be tough in the future, isn't it?

01:47:39.810 --> 01:47:41.860
Even within this galaxy,

01:47:41.860 --> 01:47:44.920
the Baudelzer Jalapalams Plus Mobile Fortress

01:47:44.920 --> 01:47:48.420
should be able to move more than 1,000 ships.

01:47:48.420 --> 01:47:50.720
You're right.

01:47:50.720 --> 01:47:55.710
However, even with just one ship, this much is possible.

01:47:55.710 --> 01:47:58.710
We have no choice but to believe in the power of culture.

01:49:33.040 --> 01:49:38.360
What was it?

01:49:38.360 --> 01:49:40.480
It's just a popular song.

01:49:40.480 --> 01:49:43.230
Popular song?

01:49:43.230 --> 01:49:57.910
It's an ordinary love song that was popular in the town of the aliens tens of thousands of years ago.

01:50:12.160 --> 01:50:12.610
What?

01:50:50.670 --> 01:51:00.000
One, two, three, four, one, two, three, four.
